promptTemplate:
Help me redesign an assessment to be resilient to AI-generated submissions while staying fair and gradable at scale.

CURRENT ASSESSMENT:
{{CURRENT_ASSESSMENT}}

SKILL IT'S SUPPOSED TO MEASURE:
{{SKILL}}

CLASS CONTEXT (size, grading support, format constraints):
{{CLASS_CONTEXT}}

1. Identify what about the current format makes it easy to fake with AI without demonstrating the underlying skill.
2. Propose 3-4 concrete redesign options (e.g. process documentation, oral component, personalized data, in-class element), each with a one-line tradeoff.
3. For your top recommendation, draft the revised assessment prompt and an explicit AI-use policy statement for it.
